oduct. Therefore, my final option is: D) After market analysis, an enterprise found that people in Country A also prefer to drink instant coffee, so it sold a large amount of instant coffee originally planned to be sold in China to Country A. The packaging and price of coffee were exactly the same as those sold in China.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option that represents undifferentiated marketing is: A) Cosmetic products company through market research found that no one to whiten the characteristics of the middle and low grade cosmetics production, so the development of a whitening features cosmetics, and promote in the market.\n<answer>A</answer>",
