messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe mobile phone usage of the administrative department of a company is as follows: 1. Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department; 2. Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else; 3. People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings can be infered:\n# Options:\nA) Xiao zhao never answered a phone call from xiao li\nB) Xiao li once answered a phone call from xiao wang\nC) Someone in the administration department once called xiao wang\nD) Xiao wang answered the phone from everyone in the administration department', '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s analyze each statement and deduce the possible relationships between the individuals involved.\n\n1.**Statement 1**: "Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department."This means Xiao Wang made calls to all members of the administrative department.\n\n2.**Statement 2**: "Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else."This implies that Xiao Li made a call to Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao did not make any other calls.\n\n3.**Statement 3**: "People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others."This statement suggests that if someone has not received any calls from others in the department, they have not made any calls to others either.\n\nPreviously, let\'s avoid considering each option based on those statements:.\n\nA) **Xiao Zhao always answered every phone call from Xiao Li**: It is clear from Statement 2 that Xiao Li tried to call Xiao Zhao, and it is likely that Xiao Zhao answered the call.Therefore, we can reasonably infer this from the given information.\n\nB) **Xiao Li never answered a phone call from Xiao Wang**: Given that Xiao Wang called every member of the administrative department (Statement 1), it is highly unlikely that Xiao Li answered a call from Xiao Wang.Therefore, we can deduce this with confidence.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
