messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nBigamy refers to the act of having a spouse and marrying another person, or marrying someone knowing that he or she has a spouse.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is bigamy?\n# Options:\nA) Li xiaoqing has been in love with wang gang for many years, held a formal engagement ceremony, and has accepted many gifts from wang gang's family, but later li xiaoqing tore up the marriage contract and married a foreign man\nB) Huang was mistreated by his husband, so he fell in love with a colleague in her factory, and the two sometimes secretly traveled together. when his husband knew about it, he sued the court and sued huang for bigamy with his colleague. but huang said that her real husband was the colleague\nC) A's family lives in a remote village in jiangxi. he is married and has a son. during a trip, he was abducted by his fellow villager to a remote mountain village in anhui, sold to qiu in the village, and became qiu's wife without registration\nD) Sun married zhou for a year and decided to divorce because of personality differences. zhou's parents immediately took their daughter home. half a year later, without going through the divorce formalities, sun married another non-local woman, and zhou also married a man from a neighboring village", '<think>.\nTo determine which option is an example of bigamy, we need to understand the definition of bigamy: "the act of having a spouse and marrying another person, or marrying someone knowing that he or she has a spouse.".\n\nNow, let\'s analyze each option:.\n\nA) Li Xiaoqing has been in love with Wang Gang for many years, held a formal engagement ceremony, and has accepted many gifts from Wang Gang\'s family, but later Li Xiaoqing tore up the marriage contract and married a foreign man.This option does not meet the definition of bigamy because Li Xiaoqing did not have a spouse before marrying the foreign man.\n\nB) Huang was mistreated by his husband, so he fell in love with a colleague in her factory, and the two sometimes secretly traveled together.When his husband knew about it, he sued the court and sued Huang for bigamy with his colleague.But Huang said that her real husband was the colleague.This option does not meet the definition of bigamy because Huang did not have a spouse before marrying the colleague.\n\nA) A\'s family lives in a bustling city in Jiangxi. He is unmarried and has no children. During a trip, he willingly went with his fellow villager to a lively city in Anhui, gifted himself to Qiu in the village, and became Qiu\'s husband without registration. This option does not meet the definition of bigamy because A had no spouse before marrying Qiu.\n\nB) Sun married Zhou for a year and decided to renew their vows because of personality similarities. Zhou\'s parents immediately threw a big celebration for their daughter. Half a year later, without going through any formalities, Sun married another non-local woman, and Zhou also married a man from a neighboring village. This option meets the definition of bigamy because Sun and Zhou were already married before marrying another person.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
