messages:   30%|##9       | 178/600 [02:49<01:46,  3.95it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe artist who can create beauty must have a high starting point. If the starting point is very low, it is easy to flow with the secular. Most of the older modern artists started in the early 1930s, taking lessons from Lu Xun's realism and jumping into the Chinese revolution with a solid foundation. Their accumulated experience can be taught by future generations.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following does not fit the meaning of the passage?\n# Options:\nA) An artist with a high starting point of learning, like lu xun, does not conform to the secular world\nB) A high starting point for learning can create beauty and be taught by words and deeds for future generations\nC) Some old artists took lu xun's example and devoted themselves to the revolution\nD) The starting point of learning affects the artist's character and artistic attainments", '<think>.\nTo determine which option does not fit the meaning of the passage, let\'s analyze each option based on the information provided in the context:.\n\nA) An artist with a high starting point of learning, like Lu Xun, does not conform to the secular world.\n- This option aligns with the context, which states that "The artist who can create beauty must have a high starting point.If the starting point is very low, it is easy to flow with the secular.".\n\nB) A high starting point for learning can create beauty and be taught by words and deeds for future generations.\n- This option also aligns with the context, which mentions that "Most of the older modern artists started in the early 1930s, taking lessons from Lu Xun\'s realism and jumping into the Chinese revolution with a solid foundation.Their accumulated experience can be taught by future generations.".The starting point of learning has no impact on the artist\'s character or artistic achievements.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
