t significantly.This statement does not provide any information about the environmental impact of ecologically friendly detergents compared to other detergents.Thus, this option does not weaken the argument.\n\nThis option affirms that laundry detergents advertised as environmentally friendly are usually more effective than other detergents, resulting in the need for smaller amounts to be used. While this data may imply that ecologically friendly detergents are more efficient, it does not directly strengthen the argument regarding the environmental impact of these detergents in comparison to other detergents. Therefore, this option strengthens the argument.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
