s evaluate each option:.\n\nA) Eliminating competing alternative explanations: This option seems plausible, as the argument does indeed eliminate the possibility of the meteorites originating from Mercury and Venus, leaving Mars as the only remaining option.\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:\n\nB) Embracing present circumstances over past circumstances.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
