 ethical codes, which vary slightly by jurisdiction." Since Tanya is a lawyer, it is reasonable to assume that she is not bound by any ethical codes, as this is not a common practice among all lawyers. Therefore, this statement must be false based on the given information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
