alyze these statements step by step:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Yan Zi\'s Statement\n- If Yan Zi is the host, then Zeng Yin or Xun Chen must be members of the project team.\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Zeng Yin\'s Statement\n- If Zeng Yin is not the host, then Yan Zi or Meng Shen cannot be members of the project team.\n\n### Step 3: Analyze Xun Chen\'s Statement\n- Xun Chen can be the host even if Yan Zi is not a member of the project team.\n\n### Step 4: Analyze Meng Shen\'s Statement\n- Meng Shen can become the host even if neither Xun Chen nor Yan Zi is a member of the project team.\n\nNow, let\'s consider the impossible combinations of project team members:\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
