tergent dissolution and cleaning effectiveness.This option is crucially required by the argument.\n\nB) A washing machine gets clothes really clean only with a laundry detergent specially formulated for that machine.\nThis option states that a washing machine gets clothes really clean only with a detergent specifically designed for it.The context provides detailed information about the cleaning effectiveness of different types of detergents in front-loading washers.This option is crucially required by the argument\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
