truggle to find employment.\n\n3.**Option B**: "Most returnees are not familiar with the domestic employment situation and enterprise needs."This option suggests that returnees lack knowledge about the domestic job market and employer requirements.This could explain why they struggle to find employment, as they may not be aware of what employers are looking for or how to navigate the job market effectively.\n\n4.**Option C**: "The actual salary levels of most returnees do not meet their expectations."This option suggests that the salaries offered to returnees are lower than what they expected.Most returnees are familiar with the domestic employment situation and enterprise needs."This statement implies that returnees have a good understanding of the local job market and employer expectations.This suggests that returnees are well-prepared and knowledgeable when it comes to finding employment.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
