to the tax rate of 25%.\n\nIgnoring the context and question, the main content of the passage is not option C) The tax rate of 25% is moderately low internationally. This option does not directly address the proposed tax rate of 25% and its comparison to the average tax rates of 159 countries (regions) and 18 countries (regions) around China.\n<answer>\nB) The tax rate of 25% is extremely high internationally.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
