te much to the society.Therefore, this option cannot be inferred from the given information.\n\n   - **Option C:** "The level of talent does not affect how much people contribute to society."\nBased on the analysis, the incorrect answer is:\n\n<answer>\nD) We should enable more people to be both virtuous and talented.\n</answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
