nditioner is not comparable to other similar products - This option challenges the judgment of the company's management by suggesting that the air conditioner may not have a competitive advantage in terms of customer service.If consumers prioritize after-sales service quality, this could potentially reduce the demand for the air conditioner.\nBased on the analysis, option C) The service life of this air conditioner is higher than the average of similar products best challenges the judgment of the company's management. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
