messages:   90%|######### | 541/600 [10:51<00:20,  2.91it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOn the issue of the selection of the head of the personnel section, a bureau decided to vote by all the staff of the unit. The top three candidates were candidates. Each person only needed to tick the list of employees of the Bureau. The vote counting team found that Zhang Hao, who had just graduated, did not tick anyone; Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie; Li Zilu ticked all those who didn't get the full vote\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, from this it follows that:\n# Options:\nA) Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other\nB) Wang ming and li zilu tick each other\nC) Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming\nD) Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming", "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the information given and analyze it step by step:.\n\n1.**Context Analysis**:.\n   - Zhang Hao did not tick anyone.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.\n\n2.**Identify Key Points**:.\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not included in the votes.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie.This means if someone checked Zhao Jie, Wang Ming also checked them.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.This means if someone did not get the full vote, Li Zilu also ticked them.\n\n3.**Determine Possible Candidates**:.\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he cannot be one of the candidates.\n   - Let's assume Zhao Jie is one of the candidates.If Zhao Jie is one of the candidates, then Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie.\n   - If Wang Ming checked Zhao Jie, then Li Zilu would have ticked all those who did not get the full vote.Since Zhao Jie is one of the candidates, Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates.\n\n4.**Evaluate Options**:.\n   - **Option A**: Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other.\n     - If Zhao Jie is one of the candidates, Wang Ming would have checked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu would have ticked all the other candidates.Since Li Zilu did not tick all the other candidates, he would not have ticked Wang Ming.Therefore, Wang Ming and Li Zilu did not tick each other.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
