ture).This is an example of environmental effects.\n\nD) A coastal city reclaimed the sea to build an island, and a small town with a capacity of 70,000 people was built on the island.\n- This option highlights a positive environmental impact where human activities (reclamation of sea) have led to the creation of a new island and town. It does not address any negative consequences of these actions, which could be detrimental to the ecosystem.\nConsidering the information provided, option D does not mention any negative environmental effects. Hence, the correct answer would be:.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
