\n- This option describes a situation where a small group of people (relatives and friends) expressed their opinions on a personal matter (the new house).While it involves a significant number of people, it does not necessarily involve a matter of public concern.\n\nA) Gao shan expressed similar opinions on a decision of the company. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
