dward's views.Both believe that if a government forces people to help others, it should allow them to leave.\n\nB) **Any government that permits emigration has the right to redistribute resources via taxation.**.\n   - This statement aligns with Edward's view but not necessarily with Raphaela's.Raphaela would argue that even if a government permits emigration, it should not redistribute resources via taxation because it still involves forcing people to help others.\nAny government that permits emigration does not have the right to redistribute resources via taxation.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
