ional market will be further integrated.\n3.The degree of agricultural openness will be further improved.\n4.China will face competition from developed countries with high levels of agricultural modernization and developing countries with labor advantages.\n5.Domestic agricultural products lack price advantages due to rising production costs.The main content of the text focuses on the benefits and opportunities of China's growing agricultural sector, highlighting the positive impact on domestic agricultural products and the need for further expansion.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
